    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e964845dd8b25eedfa5db468",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“荒漠英雄”以及“<username>”──\n写着这两个名字的签名版\n被摆在旅馆大厅的显眼之处。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3289124b917263e816ea441668ce988dc2fe9dc1e404fe2717bf1292deaf662f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
