    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4011f6c69536e7014f53afdd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在这段时光中，\n深刻地感受到了\n与荒漠英雄之间无可取代的情谊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d62367d1b63f157f58656c75b6790ec664ad6b3d4e908848a44901402fa2e3fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
