      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "温泉是自古便存在于世界各地的天然疗养设施，\n许多神话与传说中也记载着有关温泉的描述。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e544788dd45c4cd95234009146243f9647e4e212d31c5b0bb7f38ed20976c94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
