      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "像是凯尔特神话的医术之神\n“提安・卡特”就是个著名的例子吧。\n他在第二次莫伊兹拉之役中──",
      "source_fingerprint": "72072c7b52973cb03917cf5175698a9145f975202b9eedc966f6c931ff98dd32",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
